      "slug": "jp-salience",
      "track": "jp",
      "kind": "visual",
      "method": "jp-salience",
      "title": {
        "en": "Shared-stroke salience",
        "zh": "共享笔画显著性",
        "ja": "共有ストロークの顕著性"
      },
      "summary": "Sample path proximity, emphasize shared stroke segments and de-emphasize exclusive ones. v1-top/v2-top are candidate strata, not different constructors.",
